{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1413,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "d2656fb43e00556ee3186c852692cfa26a722dbc",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:039c0a8b698fc90512c90a9a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上进行锻炼有助意识清醒，\r\n让精神更加敏锐。\r\n训练员也尝试看看如何？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ee94488813e37d36e3b1c78d1f1a2f2245902f4cd071b9783224f4c8db33f1b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a491e07072f291f2887cdc93",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喝啊！！\r\n纠察队员的招呼声真是精力十足，\r\n我也该向她们学习。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb63e2b84a85008261ae5a41052efec9f71518f5208f932f000542b219bb39bc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89fbb9e895c39a5ca260503a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "健康的饮食能打造出健康的身体。\r\n训练员也得好好\r\n注重营养摄取。",
      "source_fingerprint": "93022aab62c54f6d523f0323ccead3fafacdc530f0741cc03a24445d807a36ff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9369715a1cb45f430a7a936",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯。距离下一堂课还有时间……\r\n就当作顺便醒醒脑，\r\n要不要稍微做点运动呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad1cdb2bea755ffa9da6c9fa288ff6385611d0cdf203aa0f840048e060a27120",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4b290269b28f545d6ea10cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天的课程也相当充实。\r\n累积的经验将化作\r\n通往目标的养分，值得庆幸。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2eec6dfa3bf35bcc5e5ff8bf44f3c686a99d53aa9986a6972b93bf06364a3e63",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8d80cfc8ecd80c0936563ed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "静谧的夜晚宛如「止水」。\r\n这时候内心深处的\r\n「烈火」似乎也会暂时止息。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dad7a3245d3b36ff39dad75e399e624fdb349a9a8a1ac474e67acb66805b9d55",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:590ce15f07a505abde074ab7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这季节是八重樱最美的时期呢。\r\n虽然八重樱每朵花都很娇小，\r\n但一齐盛开时的景色相当壮观。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6001ac2602cdce2cb74e93d5ee9f4695a0911844754471e67ae222e81b82222",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7eb76e72f4e9d4ff6e67ddc3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每当看着旺盛燃烧的太阳\r\n我全身就会涌现力量。\r\n也能更加投入修行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e6124ec4fef60b805ab3c53d2b246d0ff6955a6e409847ef7897bd44c3feb13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b20fb81fb16fc42a0f1db816",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "说到秋天就是锻炼之秋！\r\n我将舞动如红叶，\r\n锐利迈进如破竹！喝！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a30a07d109117cee48d0b610b230eb5a07fb8e23d82d375aba3f8e3cd1c0030",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1d43690e91d0ff4cb2a8dec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果你要去铲掉林荫道上的雪，\r\n请务必让我同行。\r\n那很适合当作修行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c51e3c373efb69ffa2fddf6f28efd0f042c78959b1895cdfdad48fb102bb50c1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b0fd459c94e4750ad9fac42",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "おはようございます！今朝は\r\nチャンバラの稽古を致しました。\r\n上半身が鍛えられてよいですね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f336dc6d05e7093282cf7d9600015455b94cd3b1b9a94fef3d70e50077063f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e15e0bd769e5fed8966efc7f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "眠気には素振りです。よければ\r\n腰の刀をお貸しします。あぁ…\r\n真剣ではないのであしからず。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6aacc8d1064c2a2e5f693401a911990f6462874983ecf410bc0412809c473ecc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e99de65a7661a8505795294",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "昼休み、またバンブーさんと\r\n人違いされました。『ハチマキの\r\nせいで余計似ている』と…くすっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc0b42d85f3c9102ab17b64ba2e9684225f3e89af85ed84a604d0bae7f0730bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9f05e4aeb06c9e748277b83",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "もう昼か…腹が減っては戦はできぬ\r\nとは、よく言ったものです。\r\nむぅ…いえ、なんでもありません！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1aad44b13a51522f707125ebf534914f9ed9d905bc8bc610e652ef2617c44cc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a67c8518be7110ad320b0541",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "本日もお疲れ様です。刀はなくとも\r\n懸命に働く貴方は現代における侍。\r\n…どうぞ、ごゆるりとお休みを。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab22ba75e277bbfd19508a06c6dabd9ed716d6ecbd244441df37014113053b97",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:109c8562c0b0a05a52124bf2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "黒い衣装は、突然の闇討ちにも\r\n対処しやすそうでよいですね。\r\n不届き者は返り討ちに致します。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b5b73e68c43da149a3470412e771f7a00175807b76a9ab7e12fada4eb6435013",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ae2abb11168b700435654a1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "春のファン大感謝祭には、\r\n『ヤエノムテキ団』の方も来ます。\r\n楽しんでもらえるよう活躍せねば！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ae5fdb16eae26ac8fc634190ce343c33af27701da6dc9fd9afe90400dffe429",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5fc71acf073edd774d98103f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "心頭滅却すれば夏もまた涼し…\r\nとはいえ、この上着は見た目より\r\n風通しがいいので心配無用です。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d5e57b46d840ce8530c2593ab831d39d89723fd0b81288acd904b23fda5bc56",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c96fc5c3df8b9b8949cc775",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この衣装は現代の甲冑です。\r\n秋のレースシーズンも、勇んで\r\n乗り越えて参りたいものです。",
      "source_fingerprint": "74e5911c96e1c715bcac9ffa7a581ccc31cae93247b1049f843e2d93fa072c2a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a103429cf36c62dc8b743a5c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "運動して汗をかくと、冬でも\r\n熱いと感じる時がありますので、\r\n上着で調節できるのは助かります。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e21b1412d8e7bc6276ca17ea44937870187590d8e09ec5bf867e2bc98f00434e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63c3f4cef38436af1b33e64f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9e338ecc741ac949d3f240a82f8cc83ab075127e1514b8c6ff32e4c943f6fc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e9d68332d7f2ccac42f4f59",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ハッピーバレンタイン！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce6d8d9eca19623907ad62c3fee5b746e2a7886cd999191715aceca42bf64b29",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a72e73f1afcb3c3d0b0a2789",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要是没有祖父跟金刚八重垣流，\r\n就不会有现在的我。\r\n对他们我实在是感激不尽……",
      "source_fingerprint": "7df916c4479c5bb897adf0f028a82a7d4f16dd68c03214c752334cc938ff8911",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba0ce5d7d6555fdae24bf022",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我跟千代王她们一起去了\r\n小狗咖啡厅……实在太危险了……！\r\n如此柔弱的生物……我得守护它们！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f2c9fa7f3cad5640321ff4a91a935335b4de6df42c307ed32c8329064ae275b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89ef32c505c60605266df090",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如此泰然自若……\r\n阿尔丹的一举一动\r\n我都想向她学习。",
      "source_fingerprint": "50d9641e8c45dbd64f4b4aee160d06c71a959d129c3383797e239ad7552918f5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:936cf2a4ecce20d5bd284c8f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "乍看之下惹人怜爱的选手，到赛场上\r\n便会瞬间成为巨大的高墙……\r\n这里的每一位学生都是战士呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "caacc277a25fbd380df1fd8db58f02ac874d1d43b4198637a75d8b655a63066c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ddf8d873344031953f1b058",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "溪流说我可以把她当成妈妈\r\n向她撒娇……她是指我还不够成熟\r\n对吧！我得继续精进自己！",
      "source_fingerprint": "71a7209ddea20cb65fccf866f9edaf24949a063f5f58f5eed53085d3344bf129",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98713dbdc8fb6e0681b0dacd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我不太习惯穿西式服装……\r\n不过没问题的。\r\n我一定会跳出完美的舞蹈！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf3eaf8b47c340e409085e7bb155204a4c4b08b87d7e9e84cac4b587d875c747",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:207a8daa4da1231def2741f9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "用歌声表达获胜的喜悦和感激……\r\n胜者舞台这种文化真是美妙。",
      "source_fingerprint": "17835da759f5a225ff52d1a7dc31bccf705bbb90d8864a42e6ed2c962f9aeccd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:328ce16dbfc16f2c950f874f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这套决胜服就像道服一样，\r\n穿得很习惯呢……\r\n感觉我能以万全状态挑战比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "80795bb1cb84a8548fbb42e53583375f53cbfd6c2e77b62b6ff91f66f4d6be59",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:adb22151fe5c0033fbe6fbef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "祖父在束带的内侧写下这句话给我。\r\n不屈不挠……\r\n我要秉持这股精神持续奔跑！",
      "source_fingerprint": "33a748246bae6c51cd8ca82091984b9930422098df4517835ad884631647a0b7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:271fad3a2d8b93132f708918",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "以前我一大早就得去打扫道场。\r\n如今已无持续这个习惯……\r\n总觉得有些坐立难安。",
      "source_fingerprint": "89f380cefb72e03fa7c4a08a8cc59411e1eddda44d9fffe2e24890f3d8880a59",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f6cfffde96aa2c5a4a629d3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "餐厅的料理几乎调味都颇重呢……\r\n我偶尔会不禁想念\r\n老家料理的朴素滋味。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7861372abb949e143ac8a10b23f38ff8662dc67b6ba1c095b4a1a33ee25501a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d69330391dfcf1f1b9e06e79",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了确保明天也能\r\n以万全状态进行锻炼，\r\n得早点就寝才行……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f8e1c2a05805bfbba251dfd2bed0de4c04deb9e73065d820241697336339babf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce32b7e78c5661af65aec80a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最近道场来了几位新弟子。\r\n大家都很可……都是\r\n很有潜力的孩子呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0908f2de253a277e7e6583b9f1c9fc22705a77fc4d9ee636f04421264759ab3d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9680bf59f56b671b5333d775",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我跟小栗她们约好一起劈西瓜！\r\n是时候展现我的\r\n锻炼成果了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "09436cf14f512568a17abf8a72d2281979bcb15b15c8fc4aa2483fc4117ede4d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:943691c448ced961707c41fd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "秋天有场古武道大赛。\r\n金刚八重垣流也会参赛，\r\n有兴趣的话请务必前来观战！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7aa9fb591777fbe6b96d5264745a14dd0efddb9d17735d47903dcdd98c794d4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed037af9f6b47f823eaa67f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要不要去雪山上集训？\r\n让自己置身于严苛的环境\r\n或许有助于大幅成长喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "741a168faa46eb3db7a39e0be4905976e51c93b69fb2840d44ccd365e8e67b2e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2a8f47e32a1be34716d01c5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "相部屋のノーリーズンさんとはよく\r\n将棋を指します。彼女は居飛車党、\r\n私は振り飛車党…性格が出ますね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "43af2259f4fd8f6a8183e9642fa7aa0069dd8fe5a136a9808d9d1474aaeaf197",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:457f8b023d9ad4bfcfd6992a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "くっ、またクリークさんにほわほわ\r\nさせられてしまった！『忍法・\r\n甘やかしの術』…なんと恐ろしい。",
      "source_fingerprint": "afea56c47a1b3b83ad392021fbaca114334c80ed8c38b21251c368807810b77d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f4637f5fceff9996ae8e03d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ヒシミラクルさんの笑顔は、尊い。\r\n普通の子が普通に笑える…そんな\r\n太平の世が1番だと実感します。",
      "source_fingerprint": "df58928bf2e7b1ca162566af91a111c85a07a3dea450bf51f29e804e440e33c5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f5340eb30c73bf72ba9e5d56",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "タイシンさんは小動物のようで…\r\n護りたい…！いや、嫌がられるのは\r\n目に見えている！耐えろ、私っ…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6bd78530f5aaaec6800dc45c9e6e2d04ceed19038a9c4fcec6e2c7da6d58be07",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef3099bbf28ed3c5acd21c36",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "バンブーさんの剣道指南は難解で…\r\n『シュっと出る』『ガッと打つ』\r\nなど、感性も試されるのですよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "37802af3a912642404ebbff74fbe15f7710efc3f1035871b562b3f2c77548419",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:607f556f897f3fa662e68e8e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "すぅ～～、はあぁぁっ――！\r\n朝からハチマキを締めると、\r\n一層、気が引き締まりますね！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9fc212c7437408d6ec2557348779c30100c5468f29a4e532b159ffeaddd76a65",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea53b921a6c90f15f4bb8315",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この格好で外で昼寝をしていたら、\r\n子どもが刀の飾りをいじってきて…\r\nふふっ…一緒に遊んであげました。",
      "source_fingerprint": "06eedba2f37e2e8eab5e03f46e45ae80c14b5b2cf53b509b3d41f385f656fa11",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b26a871c15c93c465e0cb1f5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この衣装、暗いところで光るので\r\n交通安全の効果もあるのですよ！\r\n夜のランニングにも精が出ます。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b47a8eb9e91f24d1449e0894b7653a8b7f4061838c27d575adff7b5d982cfdb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a6b8a9010031f34c2fd955bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "春は実家の門下生も増えます。\r\n今年はこの衣装で演武を披露した\r\nせいか、大盛況のようでして…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b804ec36531e5930b2aeec22e9b7b293ec023fe2219ee36d2cf14296338ccaf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:588cfad661f06b9cc39790f6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この衣装、上着を脱げば\r\n水中でも戦えそうですね！\r\n1つプールで試してみましょうか。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d307454750ebe11931e4ace6c05657ef1233c75117437fb9cd101b3d0852948f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a35f5d660136a35f9531f767",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "スポーツの秋、トレーナー殿も\r\nチャンバラはいかがですか？\r\n童心に返って熱くなれますよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a8417b47d63226c5ca787fb133ad67422287ca7a8fe9243ab51f6b02827ecb0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e33a45609a108bfbe15603a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "冬ならではの戦…雪合戦！\r\n刀でも拳でもない戦いにも\r\n果敢に挑んでみせますとも！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c11d053c6b9a0f772f81eb11e51d90253a74ac02e70f5ba67f940dbefec4fcc9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:045fe64880adb75acf836e39",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "洗練されていますね。\r\nさながら未来へ臨む武将…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "30157677934cdd8892a643be725f81d3822546c3f0515d5b4afdd1eb4a52a8db",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1080df7a417b2df2c2c5f9fd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最先端の化学繊維でできている\r\nそうです。実に軽くて動きやすい！",
      "source_fingerprint": "07ad9d56fdb9b98a1b2eb7834b9dc45051b5876de98c41df917331c91e55e338",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60b0c30ae9bb47524f26b947",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "练习时间到了呢！\r\n立刻开始吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d159def3ce64c3a2df876ab2e43113630ad6fdb87532200452470111fc7ec35",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9b23f08ecce2c8bd8e00019",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いきます！",
      "source_fingerprint": "66b5f974c284f4ca1078269985507a4fed108a51fbb7be0065c762ada56e2078",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85c48757444b73b6db374049",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让你久等了。\r\n热身运动与集中精神\r\n都已完成。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5677ad57bd8dc5e945646076d7238954edd1c44ec5344f7fde79d3d91bedd23",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a7807dda7e7f86744ea29ee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了走上我所追求的道路──\r\n我要努力锻炼，\r\n全力以赴挑战……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff9eb4803c263a81a23ffa8937783c544ac2798132c51aff563fd029f6139d7f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:105136daa3d035a390f124ed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我一定要将身为竞技选手的精髓\r\n磨练到极致！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5febba296c63a037c4606b76fbc01408a6d292bf28c3f6e830a7f5db68283bad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40ecf0c2bb161b649e3fdefe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "互为师、互为徒，\r\n让我们互相切磋琢磨吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "996c3f10cd8c95c1089a49a2c16b7935db6d1b7d1bc664d620340f60a55d3f01",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d63ec78f894f1bd737dc64b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，吾师。\r\n无论面对什么考验，\r\n我都一定会克服！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a0e781897c992e8dd666ccd148df225448a9e9d37789b14aca31c64f28587aa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02c4089afc8871ae5931920e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我深信，只要是与你同行，\r\n就决不会走错路！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc357fa2cf54891f2219388b5ce4c7ee1ca21c783446644b6672ddc9384f9125",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b51e2495ee839f6bb3c4ca4e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跑步时不易踩稳的沙滩……\r\n在这里练跑会是不错的修行呢。\r\n再来就只差铁木屐了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "93048490edd35c469f55003e85c4ebdb6c17e2ed860b50a476e56e243ca98e96",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a1beb0da81a6ad93004dcb3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ふっ…！あぁ、臍下丹田に\r\n力を入れていたのです。\r\nこの格好ですと、意識しやすい。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a768531718f7a448e073be4821336ce2f5fec6d0a1ed0ce69b968b9383ad7c00",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51c8270674a9009b2e42a44c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "戦とはその前の準備で勝敗が決まる\r\nものだと、孫子も説いています。\r\nさあ、今日もトレーニングを！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6ebb8386696527b4ede892f8b13bc0a9fd4327dce62e35462119e19980f778e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:221d621f9c0a0d8b99315f58",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "私の“烈火”は、鞘なき白刃とも\r\n言い換えられましょう。己を制し、\r\n正しく振るうと誓います。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ef71f967f856f699acaaa6b6ebb8d581873512000f1d788662e28efaad52790",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a929377ae8eac8f7cd2c4884",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "身体1つで頂を目指すレース界は\r\nまさしく群雄割拠の戦国が如し！\r\nさあ、勇んで参りましょう！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2899b8d10ad4c1b2f64926e9bb34162831d7d65cb93529aaf3ab014366a50947",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a9a3be82281cd2cb291941b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "レースにおいてはトレーナー殿が\r\n軍師であらせられる。\r\n私は信じて戦うのみです。",
      "source_fingerprint": "38c43a342eb7325fe2856cac8f05a2ec195460e1409ce0b4738d275ca5ff14cf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:142dbf87928f8667f81d5681",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "トレーナー殿、参りましょう。\r\n天下への道のりは遠いですが、\r\n貴方とならきっと未来を掴めます。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1405517364c488f109b1d1d89f210d3bece8e623f4515654f2dccd57d6e083b4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d4cbcd7d0af73cefbb4c9c0f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "トレーナー殿は、さながら\r\n背中を預けた戦友。おかげさまで\r\n私は前にだけ集中できるのです！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f63f0d1f2897df10de2112adac83c78d5086d45b51e61e8555fadb57707715ed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a00c123380c36574becdaef9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要是没有你我就无法找到自己的\r\n道路──感谢你的指导！",
      "source_fingerprint": "829d5a79181188a5afaa98c6550dcedd3be4e6234bae9ade93cea74e8320b5df",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb42d8c5d0deaaf5debe6d28",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "往后我仍会持续挑战「火水合一」！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2eaee83216cd57ea376e79960c47eb8140f294221dcd61322965fa25f6b8aad9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:90bd8414fb85030c965f0acd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "レースの世界でも頂を取れました！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5622e9cefce1b8aeccc0c1dde73fb545989a7c61c0be1635d13bc8c5c433026a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:729f546eecb8b12916b0e2c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "貴方という援軍あっての成果です！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a0dd2b57d103869e4da93bedebcd52c135af01485c916d50766ba48166bd971",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9876c664a624be00d773893",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是锻炼的成果！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4815d74aa118cd5ffaef1139e36c5353a9d65667e9114fbf6fc4e580f2b53d42",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35c6e6bfbb234b4c63b99836",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "心技合一！\r\n往后我也会持续全力精进自己！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f795202d1eac6534c7f8ed31bcc182e22e3732f4016e3252a88902f6d096411d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2415254437cf8bf8329d579b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是八重无敌！喝啊！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d86d595ea89230ea2d7d7e72eb8bc0396fb7d3b7cf86d50106883c111cc178a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:314e7d037400ffa19f2be547",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "八重绽放的无敌斗志──\r\n出发，迈向自已的道路！",
      "source_fingerprint": "87d01cce683576b867898da37a783c2e139acfdf898d9fb46555b41a5b262980",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5bb124c9ec5d263092b26c28",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "成为更得力的助手！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9ef9c4d3ed76c44d5349b447c6d26d019e28be6aca53800e3adc87fbd1cbe9b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4683de7f38a451f3e2ddbf58",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "武学是没有尽头的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6705e2a04f433e839946befb42c44029f71558e9c9fc5482199af245656bb54",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3bcd7547d7872c62631cec9d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "段位が上がったようです！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8fd31719dbb2826af63d1c84e31f4f74015343791afcf3668953a5788e99ebac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04142f1263f0fd9216f17b3a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "剣もレースも、限界はない！",
      "source_fingerprint": "03b4dbe0a6e3a7d2e05520ebac00480a9385a572fb383f932b41daa512b4fb7e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "95008"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
